2.2 Distance to Nearest State Border (km)
The nearest state border uses preserved internal boundaries — we want every state line, not just the outer edge. Use st_combine() which keeps all boundaries, then cast to MULTILINESTRING.
Store as dist_to_state. Produce a flextable of the 5 cities farthest from any state border.


Code
state_border &lt;- make_border_line(states, dissolve = FALSE)

cities &lt;- add_distance_km(cities, state_border, "dist_to_state")

farthest_cities_sb &lt;- top_cities(cities, "dist_to_state") 




Code
ft_table_two &lt;- farthest_cities_sb |&gt;
    select(city, state_id, dist_to_state) |&gt;
    st_drop_geometry() |&gt;
    flextable() |&gt;
      set_header_labels(city = "City", state_id = "State", dist_to_state = "Distance (km)") |&gt;
